            "notes": "## Powers\n\n- [Self-Care](item_0b7b0332-9bf6-4905-810e-7614b914d663) : Default Choice\n- [Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198) : Better if the enemy team can't damage you or if your other support will heal you often\n\n------\n\n## Items\n\n### Core\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n- [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)\n### Flex\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) : if you selected [Self-Care](item_0b7b0332-9bf6-4905-810e-7614b914d663)\n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) : if you selected [Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198)\n------\n\n## Comment\n\n### If your picked [Self-Care](item_0b7b0332-9bf6-4905-810e-7614b914d663) :\nPlay more in your team's backline or healing on an off angle, you can play more selfish since you have self sustain as well as [Swift Step](ability_7f6c99f6-7a6f-4f67-a8fd-d6bf6a09e014), make just to heal when there is no one to shoot, that will give you free ult charge and cash as well as healing you up.\n\n### If your picked [Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198) :\nTry to abuse the 20% [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) buff you give to your allies as it is really valuable on round 1, try to heal every teammate and stay close to your other support so they can heal you when you need it.",
