            "notes": "## Items\n\n### Core\n- [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) : enhanced healing output\n- [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) : cheap [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed)\n### Flex\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) : if you selected [Self-Care](item_0b7b0332-9bf6-4905-810e-7614b914d663)\n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) : if you selected [Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198)\n- [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) : if you have extra money\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) : if you have extra money\n- [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) : if you have more than 15,250 cash\n------\n\n## Comment\n\n### If your picked [Self-Care](item_0b7b0332-9bf6-4905-810e-7614b914d663) :\nThe increase in [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) this round will allow you have a lot more self sustain, allowing to go for more agressive positioning. Still make sure to heal your team before going for some damage.\n\n### If your picked [Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198) :\nThe increase in your healing output and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) should allow your proc the buff from [Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198) a lot easier, play a lot safer this round, you will struggle versus spam damage a lot.",
