            "notes": "## Items\n\n### Core\n- [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)\n- [Teamwork Toolkit](item_d56fb90c-cbe6-4ad5-8475-0ce920f92a3f) \n- [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a)\n- [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054)\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n### Flex\n- [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) for free 20% damage reduction\n- [Farsight Focus Sash](item_103e6d35-a71f-48c7-b7b9-b89efae62242) : if your team is spread out\n- [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) : if you struggle against a [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a), a [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) or a [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6)\n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) : for more survivability\n------\n\n## Comment\n\nThese new items will allows you to enhnace your healing output by a good amount. If you struggled to stay alive last round, don't hesitate to buy [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) or [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) to die less so have an higher uptime. Now, you should be **really**  hard to take down while supporting your team like crazy. If you are getting targeted, abuse [Self-Care](item_0b7b0332-9bf6-4905-810e-7614b914d663) and use [Swift Step](ability_7f6c99f6-7a6f-4f67-a8fd-d6bf6a09e014) to teleport somewhere safe. If you aren't, don't hesitate to use [Swift Step](ability_7f6c99f6-7a6f-4f67-a8fd-d6bf6a09e014) on a DPS or your tank *sometimes* and help them win their duel or just keeping them alive.",
