            "notes": "## Powers\n\n- [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b)\n\n------\n\n## Items\n\n### Core\n- [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) for free 20% damage reduction\n- [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)\n- [Teamwork Toolkit](item_d56fb90c-cbe6-4ad5-8475-0ce920f92a3f) \n- [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a)\n- [Asa's Armaments](item_dde8f855-5e4e-4c68-9e0f-1032c13c8bda)\n- [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054)\n### Flex\n\n- [Farsight Focus Sash](item_103e6d35-a71f-48c7-b7b9-b89efae62242) : if your team is spread out\n- [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) : for more self healing\n- [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) : if you struggle against a [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a), a [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) or a [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6)\n- [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) : if  you have more than 44,250 cash\n------\n\n## Comment\n\n[Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) will allow you to play better vs debuff and bring more utility. Also pairing it with [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) will make your almost impossible to kill, if you are still scared of dying, you can buy [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) which will increase your self sustain even more. If you have cahsed it a lot of cash, you can replace [Asa's Armaments](item_dde8f855-5e4e-4c68-9e0f-1032c13c8bda) with [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48), for more self sustain and more healing.",
