            "created_at": "2025-09-30T20:35:25.791956+00:00",
            "notes": "## Powers\n\n- [Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) : Default Choice\n- [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) : If they have debuffs\n------\n\n## Items\n\n### Core\n- [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) \n- [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)\n- [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48)\n- [Spirits' Guidance](item_25513335-271e-402b-bd03-9d082a281c40)\n- [Teamwork Toolkit](item_d56fb90c-cbe6-4ad5-8475-0ce920f92a3f) \n- [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) : for more health and shield pressure\n### Flex\n\n- [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) : for more self healing\n- [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) : if they don't have a shield\n- [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) : if you struggle against a [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a), a [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) or a [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6)\n- [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) if you can't afford an epic [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) item\n------\n\n## Comment\n\nYou can use your [Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) to have more selfsustain but also as a burst heal. It also procs your buffs from [Teamwork Toolkit](item_d56fb90c-cbe6-4ad5-8475-0ce920f92a3f) and [Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198) and heals a nice amount.\nIf you picked [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68), just suzu their debuffs and get [Kitsune Rush](ability_67ce89b9-6410-415c-bc87-70dbdb19d71c) faster.",
